<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεκ-λύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>relax before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν στόμαχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					2.45e
				</span></i>
			; <i>weaken beforehand,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.566
			</span></i>; <i>reduce the force of</i> a blow, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>UP</u>
				3.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸ ἐνστατικόν</span>
			<i>weaken</i> theresistance <i>beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Top.</u>
				531.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>release first,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δεξιάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.111
				</span></i>
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-</span> cod.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>weary before the time,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ κόπῳ τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					15.16.3
				</span></i>
			:—pf.
			part.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεκλελυμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπαθεῖς.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. of distance,
				<i>weaken the force of</i> a projectile, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				3.7.22
			</span></i>:—so in 
				Pass.
			, of sounds, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.140
			</span></i>.</div>
